      "text": "/skill:tidy-recipe-authoring\n\nCreate tidy recipes for workbook `c715e6c9cd27e52dbf5b7cd5bafd54ea49972649c8f679496e1ccce169c426b4--criminal-courts-2021-22-cube-14-source.xlsx`.\n\n- Publication: Criminal Courts, Australia (Australian Bureau of Statistics)\n- Release or year: 2021\n- Sheets needing a recipe: 14 of 14\n\n| sheet | sheet_sha256 | current recipe |\n|---|---|---|\n| \"Contents\" | 1104d7929a41d03d045f2a80ffc394726dde3f828852bede896b6a66f4ade075 | missing |\n| \"FDV Table 1\" | 9521440c099895727ad8fe55a17bbdb79453726812471d75210f0e5e957c169f | missing |\n| \"FDV Table 2\" | 65181cad3f3a16d038b8fa61341b3233f2aaf1b132e069b7b2a8fdf1bc9da718 | missing |\n| \"FDV Table 3\" | 0249ce35589b4c6e34c533c3be2af089683e13a01c3e05c85e6493669089437e | missing |\n| \"FDV Table 4\" | cd07ad37ca9cd1542869077af56d3fbc1fea76de023b15de6043e0c487d54667 | missing |\n| \"FDV Table 5\" | 0cc2edd27c74b11bbe590b4a3664fad9eeee795a060621694eb9a84eeda06f2d | missing |\n| \"FDV Table 6\" | fc2a729a1e0471dd5bce01badb2f429c23c5ec40b0332a7ad1eab6035c998d02 | missing |\n| \"FDV Table 7\" | bb0a5c0b3f82481404771f22e7f2dd0b2503a7d79e8f6ba7272cf82eca8cc03a | missing |\n| \"FDV Table 8\" | 3ffc666ae13fb9057cf94e6ab47160e68a55700401f7d8ca8c5da58b648824f3 | missing |\n| \"FDV Table 9\" | ff627e966b5a5c94d0214b9dc83d9f7aafeab71b913dde4cd8ec855c489dcc86 | missing |\n| \"FDV Table 10\" | 08a475f9e079806a1f59e955fbd690dfd76875763d8c0a51b25b9551eaec0bde | missing |\n| \"FDV Table 11\" | 21eb98e0f3bb6719e908460510ef24d9b4a98c91f404d862951f46ea75097967 | missing |\n| \"FDV Table 12\" | 96f1ae71c08a0e42c2eef2ef1e53a6159814449691ef0849e2c9daa2f5a034b6 | missing |\n| \"FDV Table 13\" | c53317f7d4ce7c4b2005502628cda35ab75073f8b714d67883b2e1f2241ecbf5 | missing |\n\nRelated workbooks:\n- None\n\nWork through every sheet listed above using the skill's workflow. Use\n`codemode` scripts to call the recipe tools, and batch the work: for example,\nlist the workbook and check templates for all sheets in one script, then read\ngrids and test recipes a few sheets at a time. Keep script output short.\n\nName dimensions from `dictionary/dimensions.csv` (see the skill's\n`references/naming.md`); declare any name it lacks in `new_dimensions`.\n\nWrite each recipe to `tidy-recipes/<sheet_sha256>.json` and finish every sheet\nwith `submit_recipe`. You may only write recipe files for this workbook.\n\nEnd with one line per sheet: `sheet | kind | status | records | remaining failures`."
